(6017626, 882244, 100820, '<td valign="top">i can see your reflection!  i feel as though there are a few distracting elements in this - the plaque in the top left, your reflection, the edge of the window itself...  but a tighter crop wouldnt work wither.  maybe a different composition where those elements may have worked FOR you?  it is certainly a fascination subject!</td>', 'i can see your reflection!  i feel as though there are a few distracting elements in this - the plaque in the top left, your reflection, the edge of the window itself...  but a tighter crop wouldnt work wither.  maybe a different composition where those elements may have worked FOR you?  it is certainly a fascination subject!', '2010-05-19 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017627, 883059, 100820, '<td valign="top">GREAT tones.  i wish the bottom of the keys wasnt cut off though.</td>', 'GREAT tones.  i wish the bottom of the keys wasnt cut off though.', '2010-05-19 23:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017630, 883137, 117285, '<td valign="top">begs for a rim light.  I don''t want to eat those sesame seeds yet</td>', 'begs for a rim light.  I don''t want to eat those sesame seeds yet', '2010-05-19 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017632, 883593, 100820, '<td valign="top">topaz?  i personally am not a fan of the high contrast look.  the composition is spot on though.</td>', 'topaz?  i personally am not a fan of the high contrast look.  the composition is spot on though.', '2010-05-19 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017638, 880955, 100820, '<td valign="top">i am not a huge fan of the angle/composition of this.  but i do like the contrast between the black handle and the white door.</td>', 'i am not a huge fan of the angle/composition of this.  but i do like the contrast between the black handle and the white door.', '2010-05-19 23:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017639, 881606, 117285, '<td valign="top">well shot for a film close up but maybe not to last forever as a still</td>', 'well shot for a film close up but maybe not to last forever as a still', '2010-05-19 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017640, 883395, 100820, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but my eye just keeps trying to look around the knob, it is almost annoying.  im sorry!  i love the color though...</td>', 'i like the idea, but my eye just keeps trying to look around the knob, it is almost annoying.  im sorry!  i love the color though...', '2010-05-19 23:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017643, 883547, 117285, '<td valign="top">too over-exposed and not enough focus but the composition is pretty good but i question that border.  Is it legal?</td>', 'too over-exposed and not enough focus but the composition is pretty good but i question that border.  Is it legal?', '2010-05-19 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017646, 882968, 100820, '<td valign="top">i love the snatch of the bar inside.  it seems to tell a story.  the quality is not very good in the dark areas, however.</td>', 'i love the snatch of the bar inside.  it seems to tell a story.  the quality is not very good in the dark areas, however.', '2010-05-19 23:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017650, 883093, 117285, '<td valign="top">nice dutch angle and composition but otherwise kinda dull</td>', 'nice dutch angle and composition but otherwise kinda dull', '2010-05-19 23:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017651, 881926, 100820, '<td valign="top">something feels...  off...  about the composition, but i actually think i like it.</td>', 'something feels...  off...  about the composition, but i actually think i like it.', '2010-05-19 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017653, 881895, 117285, '<td valign="top">a little too low key for my taste</td>', 'a little too low key for my taste', '2010-05-19 23:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017655, 881606, 100820, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC idea, fabulous execution!</td>', 'FANTASTIC idea, fabulous execution!', '2010-05-19 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017657, 883391, 100820, '<td valign="top">the high contrast is not very pleasing to me in this instance.  i do enjoy the composition, including the reflection in the top right.</td>', 'the high contrast is not very pleasing to me in this instance.  i do enjoy the composition, including the reflection in the top right.', '2010-05-19 23:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017658, 883562, 117285, '<td valign="top">it''s definitely low key but maybe to the detriment of being a good example in this challenge</td>', 'it''s definitely low key but maybe to the detriment of being a good example in this challenge', '2010-05-19 23:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017659, 882100, 100820, '<td valign="top">it would be perfect (and probably impossible) without the camera reflection!  jealous of your rig though...</td>', 'it would be perfect (and probably impossible) without the camera reflection!  jealous of your rig though...', '2010-05-19 23:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017660, 881678, 100820, '<td valign="top">great detail!</td>', 'great detail!', '2010-05-19 23:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017668, 881569, 117285, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  Does this fit here in this challenge?</td>', 'I don''t get it.  Does this fit here in this challenge?', '2010-05-19 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017810, 881569, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am really really trying to find some connection to the challenge topic and I just don''t see it. Please also submit an image that uses the full size allowed (800 pixels on the longest side)</td>', 'I am really really trying to find some connection to the challenge topic and I just don''t see it. Please also submit an image that uses the full size allowed (800 pixels on the longest side)', '2010-05-20 01:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017811, 883178, 66515, '<td valign="top">lots of potential here. I''d prefer there to be more depth of field so we can appreciate the textures in the door itself more.</td>', 'lots of potential here. I''d prefer there to be more depth of field so we can appreciate the textures in the door itself more.', '2010-05-20 01:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6017815, 882852, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit overprocessed as there is some haloing around the edges of the building. I like the composition however as it draws the eye to the pull. It would be nice if there was a bit more light on the whole pull as only the bottom is really well lit.</td>', 'A bit overprocessed as there is some haloing around the edges of the building. I like the composition however as it draws the eye to the pull. It would be nice if there was a bit more light on the whole pull as only the bottom is really well lit.', '2010-05-20 01:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018081, 881279, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wow. This one took me quite awhile to figure out, and I''m still wondering if I''m really getting it. I''m going to assume that I am and give it an 8.</td>', 'Wow. This one took me quite awhile to figure out, and I''m still wondering if I''m really getting it. I''m going to assume that I am and give it an 8.', '2010-05-20 08:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018082, 883599, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think it''s interesting and clever. Well done.  8</td>', 'I think it''s interesting and clever. Well done.  8', '2010-05-20 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018127, 883521, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice job with the lighting, it really stops the eye from wondering away from the lock.</td>', 'nice job with the lighting, it really stops the eye from wondering away from the lock.', '2010-05-20 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018130, 881895, 104841, '<td valign="top">I think that you had the makings for a good shot, I feel that is is a little bit underexposed and it rather flat.</td>', 'I think that you had the makings for a good shot, I feel that is is a little bit underexposed and it rather flat.', '2010-05-20 09:28:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6018172, 883105, 117582, '<td valign="top">Colors and textures strong but weak looking. Fixtures strong but weak. A paradox of locks.</td>', 'Colors and textures strong but weak looking. Fixtures strong but weak. A paradox of locks.', '2010-05-20 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018311, 883658, 100820, '<td valign="top">great execution of a wonderful idea....  my only gripe (its tiny!) is that it seems as though it is a little crooked...  i hvaent checked it with grids or anything, but thats what my eyes are trying to tell my brain.</td>', 'great execution of a wonderful idea....  my only gripe (its tiny!) is that it seems as though it is a little crooked...  i hvaent checked it with grids or anything, but thats what my eyes are trying to tell my brain.', '2010-05-20 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018313, 881254, 100820, '<td valign="top">there are quite a few shots in this challenge of car door handles where the reflection (at least to me) are ALL wrong...  this is one where it is all RIGHT...</td>', 'there are quite a few shots in this challenge of car door handles where the reflection (at least to me) are ALL wrong...  this is one where it is all RIGHT...', '2010-05-20 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018317, 881569, 100820, '<td valign="top">this seems to me as though it is a shoehorn, because it is not entirely clear to me what your take on the theme is.  the picture itself is also not stellar as far as composition...  i find the thumb (in particular) in the background very distracting, as well as the flower.</td>', 'this seems to me as though it is a shoehorn, because it is not entirely clear to me what your take on the theme is.  the picture itself is also not stellar as far as composition...  i find the thumb (in particular) in the background very distracting, as well as the flower.', '2010-05-20 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018337, 882100, 116489, '<td valign="top">I found the wood on the side distracting; I would have preferred a square crop that only included the knob itself.</td>', 'I found the wood on the side distracting; I would have preferred a square crop that only included the knob itself.', '2010-05-20 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018419, 882575, 101536, '<td valign="top">Love this shot it''s got a real ''arty'' feel about it - superb!</td>', 'Love this shot it''s got a real ''arty'' feel about it - superb!', '2010-05-20 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018467, 882968, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the difference in scene from one side of the door to the other.</td>', 'I like the difference in scene from one side of the door to the other.', '2010-05-20 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018512, 883658, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2010-05-20 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018513, 883137, 114896, '<td valign="top">Lol, very creative.</td>', 'Lol, very creative.', '2010-05-20 14:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018516, 880891, 114896, '<td valign="top">The shadows remind me of prison bars. I also like that the fingernails are the same color as the box. Very nice.</td>', 'The shadows remind me of prison bars. I also like that the fingernails are the same color as the box. Very nice.', '2010-05-20 14:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018519, 881725, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this. I like all of the browns and how each has a unique texture.</td>', 'I like the composition of this. I like all of the browns and how each has a unique texture.', '2010-05-20 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018520, 881111, 114896, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective. Makes me fell like I''m 2 inches tall.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective. Makes me fell like I''m 2 inches tall.', '2010-05-20 14:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018523, 882568, 114896, '<td valign="top">This makes me a little dizzy. Certainly draws the eye in.</td>', 'This makes me a little dizzy. Certainly draws the eye in.', '2010-05-20 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018524, 881254, 114896, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection.</td>', 'Love the reflection.', '2010-05-20 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018525, 882575, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color. I like the texture in the door knob and the door.</td>', 'Nice use of color. I like the texture in the door knob and the door.', '2010-05-20 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018527, 883434, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. For such a small subject I really feel drawn into the picture.</td>', 'Nice macro. For such a small subject I really feel drawn into the picture.', '2010-05-20 14:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018529, 881806, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the contrast in the textures.</td>', 'Nice, love the contrast in the textures.', '2010-05-20 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018533, 883147, 114896, '<td valign="top">The hinge looks like it is pointing to the heart.</td>', 'The hinge looks like it is pointing to the heart.', '2010-05-20 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018534, 881803, 114896, '<td valign="top">Striking geometry. Wonderful texture.</td>', 'Striking geometry. Wonderful texture.', '2010-05-20 14:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018535, 881056, 114896, '<td valign="top">The color and texture here are wonderful. I like the vertical and horizontals lines too.</td>', 'The color and texture here are wonderful. I like the vertical and horizontals lines too.', '2010-05-20 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018536, 883623, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflection</td>', 'Nice use of reflection', '2010-05-20 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018537, 883283, 114896, '<td valign="top">The title adds a lot to this. The perspective is great too.</td>', 'The title adds a lot to this. The perspective is great too.', '2010-05-20 14:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018539, 883093, 114896, '<td valign="top">The angle is disorienting but it''s nice to have to think about something.</td>', 'The angle is disorienting but it''s nice to have to think about something.', '2010-05-20 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018541, 883220, 114896, '<td valign="top">Great door knocker - love the ears.</td>', 'Great door knocker - love the ears.', '2010-05-20 14:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018543, 882943, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the color and geometry in this. The drape of the chain is so different from the door.</td>', 'I like the color and geometry in this. The drape of the chain is so different from the door.', '2010-05-20 14:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018544, 882842, 114896, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2010-05-20 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018545, 883217, 114896, '<td valign="top">Love the microphones - very creative!</td>', 'Love the microphones - very creative!', '2010-05-20 14:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018546, 881392, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and angle on this shot. The title works well too.</td>', 'Nice perspective and angle on this shot. The title works well too.', '2010-05-20 14:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018547, 883599, 114896, '<td valign="top">Creative use of shadow. I think the tilt adds to the photo as well.</td>', 'Creative use of shadow. I think the tilt adds to the photo as well.', '2010-05-20 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018548, 882370, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Love the perspective and color as well.</td>', 'Nice title. Love the perspective and color as well.', '2010-05-20 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018549, 881555, 114896, '<td valign="top">Love the color and texture. Good lines.</td>', 'Love the color and texture. Good lines.', '2010-05-20 14:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018551, 882330, 114896, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field.</td>', 'Nice depth of field.', '2010-05-20 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018552, 883596, 114896, '<td valign="top">I like the off center focus.</td>', 'I like the off center focus.', '2010-05-20 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018823, 881280, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice textures. I think shooting near dawn or dusk, to get the golden side light, would really have set this off.</td>', 'Nice textures. I think shooting near dawn or dusk, to get the golden side light, would really have set this off.', '2010-05-20 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018825, 881895, 76335, '<td valign="top">Dull and dark. At a minimum, this should be in black and white; it would be a more effective low key.</td>', 'Dull and dark. At a minimum, this should be in black and white; it would be a more effective low key.', '2010-05-20 18:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018831, 881489, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! All the subtle textures and layers and details and angles really set this off.</td>', 'Beautiful! All the subtle textures and layers and details and angles really set this off.', '2010-05-20 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6018832, 882405, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and excellent textures.</td>', 'Nicely composed and excellent textures.', '2010-05-20 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
